    "body": "## Summary\n- enforce symmetric user-block policy before persisting chat messages\n- block both normal sends and idempotent retry paths when either participant blocked the other\n- prevent blocked sends from creating notifications or realtime events\n- keep existing participant chat history readable instead of deleting evidence\n- add regression coverage and document interaction/lifecycle boundaries\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- enforcement is server-side through `UserBlockService.isInteractionBlocked`\n- blocked sends fail before persistence, notification creation or websocket publication\n- block state does not expose the other user's private block list\n- blocking does not mutate escrow, job lifecycle, location access or moderation records\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build, Flyway/container runtime checks and applicable smoke workflows. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
